{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "172", "x": 0.8965598059325655, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03718344267107032, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Over the past 100 years, workplaces in the UK have on the whole become", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.12393667166651151, "w": 0.7715003286437394, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "considerably safer. Employers are legally required to provide well-", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.14277420698693738, "w": 0.7666715058444863, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "maintained personal protective equipment or PPE. Anything from goggles to", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.16161166686457823, "w": 0.7716745185402538, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "full bodysuits to workers who need it free of charge. But most PPE is", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.18059744725757176, "w": 0.7713485917121083, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "designed to fit men. A recent report found that employers often think that", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.19943490713521264, "w": 0.7715002261187857, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "when it comes to female workers, all they need to do to comply with this", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2182723670128535, "w": 0.7713696093276383, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "legal requirement is to buy jackets, for example, designed for a small man.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.23725822284863204, "w": 0.7719103259340049, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "The problem with this is that women can be tall and still have much smaller", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2560956827262729, "w": 0.7712824631169042, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "shoulders than the average man. Ill-fitting PPE such as high vise jackets,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.27497018501135945, "w": 0.771808313604969, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "vests, and body armor can put women at risk. The report found that 95% of", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2938077203317853, "w": 0.7721720721410686, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "women said that their PPE often hampered their work and that this problem", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.31279350072477885, "w": 0.7714782857786714, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "was worst in the emergency services, particularly the police.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3316309417417234, "w": 0.6230351733384267, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Another problem is related to comfort at work. A very common scenario in", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.35046840161936427, "w": 0.7713911395679373, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "offices in summertime is to see women wrapped in blankets or wearing", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.36945418201235786, "w": 0.7719273450763365, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "sweaters while the air conditioning is on high. Meanwhile, the men are in", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3882917173327837, "w": 0.7714567555383723, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "shorts and t-shirts. This is due to differences in metabolic rates for men and", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.40712913948903207, "w": 0.7716223333387672, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "women. There is a standard setting for air conditioning to be at a", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4259666370880654, "w": 0.7713478740374317, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "temperature of 21° designed to suit men. And in most modern offices, it's not", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.44495241748105896, "w": 0.7717638177750178, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "possible to turn the air conditioning up or down. This means that many", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4637898773586998, "w": 0.7715219614089922, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "offices which mainly employ women are wasting energy by having the air", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.48265208246982777, "w": 0.7714349177232119, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "conditioning set too high.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5016379005842139, "w": 0.26636980053667714, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "As you can see from the examples I've just mentioned, there are serious", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5204753604618547, "w": 0.7715785551834925, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "consequences for designs which don't consider the needs of all users.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5393128203394956, "w": 0.7189835614564818, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}